# Lab 06 – Regression and Classification

## Overview
This lab introduced regression and classification, two major types of supervised machine learning.

## What I Learned
- Regression is used to predict numbers
- Classification is used to predict categories
- How to train and evaluate basic supervised learning models

## Tools Used
- Python
- scikit-learn
- pandas

## Reflection
This lab helped me understand when to use regression versus classification depending on the type of problem being solved.
